:36},{"text":"연산이","x":1404,"y":1134,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"동","x":1509,"y":1136,"width":33,"height":34}]},{"text":"기적으로 혹은 비동기적으로 수행되느나 하는 것이다. 동기식 쓰기는 저장장치 서브시","words":[{"text":"기적으로","x":313,"y":1197,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"혹은","x":454,"y":1196,"width":64,"height":35},{"text":"비동기적으로","x":533,"y":1195,"width":184,"height":36},{"text":"수행되느나","x":731,"y":1195,"width":153,"height":37},{"text":"하는","x":898,"y":1195,"width":61,"height":36},{"text":"것이다.","x":975,"y":1196,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"동기식","x":1087,"y":1196,"width":90,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기는","x":1194,"y":1197,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"저장장치","x":1304,"y":1195,"width":123,"height":37},{"text":"서브시","x":1447,"y":1195,"width":90,"height":36}]},{"text":"스템이 요청을 받은 순서대로 이루어지며, 쓰기가 버퍼에 저장되지 않는다. 따라서 호출","words":[{"text":"스템이","x":312,"y":1257,"width":92,"height":36},{"text":"요청을","x":420,"y":1256,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"받은","x":528,"y":1256,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"순서대로","x":600,"y":1256,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"이루어지며,","x":738,"y":1256,"width":158,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기가","x":909,"y":1256,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"버퍼에","x":1016,"y":1256,"width":86,"height":36},{"text":"저장되지","x":1119,"y":1256,"width":118,"height":36},{"text":"않는다.","x":1254,"y":1256,"width":101,"height":36},{"text":"따라서","x":1370,"y":1255,"width":91,"height":37},{"text":"호출","x":1478,"y":1256,"width":64,"height":35}]},{"text":"루틴은 데이터가 디스크 드라이브에 도착한 후에야 수행을 계속할 수 있다. 대부분은 비","words":[{"text":"루틴은","x":311,"y":1317,"width":97,"height":37},{"text":"데이터가","x":420,"y":1316,"width":126,"height":36},{"text":"디스크","x":559,"y":1316,"width":91,"height":36},{"text":"드라이브에","x":662,"y":1316,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"도착한","x":827,"y":1316,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"후에야","x":930,"y":1317,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"수행을","x":1034,"y":1317,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"계속할","x":1140,"y":1317,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"수","x":1243,"y":1317,"width":32,"height":35},{"text":"있다.","x":1288,"y":1317,"width":68,"height":35},{"text":"대부분은","x":1371,"y":1317,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"비","x":1511,"y":1316,"width":27,"height":36}]},{"text":"동기식 쓰기가 행해진다. 비동기식의 경우 데이터를 개시에 저장하고 호출자에게 제어","words":[{"text":"동기식","x":310,"y":1377,"width":93,"height":37},{"text":"쓰기가","x":421,"y":1376,"width":96,"height":36},{"text":"행해진다.","x":532,"y":1376,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"비동기식의","x":680,"y":1376,"width":149,"height":37},{"text":"경우","x":848,"y":1377,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"데이터를","x":923,"y":1377,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"개시에","x":1061,"y":1377,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"저장하고","x":1168,"y":1377,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"호출자에게","x":1305,"y":1377,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"제어","x":1478,"y":1377,"width":58,"height":36}]},{"text":"를 돌려준다. 대부부의 쓰기는 비동기적으로 이루어진다. 그러나 메타데이터 쓰기 작업","words":[{"text":"를","x":310,"y":1440,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"돌려준다.","x":356,"y":1436,"width":134,"height":36},{"text":"대부부의","x":508,"y":1436,"width":120,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기는","x":644,"y":1437,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"비동기적으로","x":752,"y":1437,"width":183,"height":36},{"text":"이루어진다.","x":950,"y":1437,"width":159,"height":37},{"text":"그러나","x":1125,"y":1438,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"메타데이터","x":1232,"y":1438,"width":151,"height":36},{"text":"쓰기","x":1401,"y":1437,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"작업","x":1477,"y":1437,"width":59,"height":35}]},{"text":"은 통상 동기식으로 수행된다. 운영체제는 흔히 오픈 시스템 콜에 쓰기 작업을 동기식으","words":[{"text":"은","x":310,"y":1500,"width":33,"height":33},{"text":"통상","x":354,"y":1497,"width":66,"height":36},{"text":"동기식으로","x":430,"y":1497,"width":157,"height":35},{"text":"수행된다.","x":599,"y":1497,"width":131,"height":36},{"text":"운영체제는","x":744,"y":1498,"width":154,"height":36},{"text":"흔히","x":909,"y":1498,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"오픈","x":982,"y":1501,"width":64,"height":32},{"text":"시스템","x":1058,"y":1499,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"콜에","x":1161,"y":1499,"width":59,"height":35},{"text":"쓰기","x":1235,"y":1498,"width":58,"height":36},{"text":"작업을","x":1309,"y":1498,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"동기식으","x":1414,"y":1498,"width":126,"height":35}]},{"text":"로 수행할 것을 요청하는 플래그를 포함한다. 예를 들어, 데이터베이스는 이 기능을 원자","words":[{"text":"로","x":311,"y":1562,"width":32,"height":28},{"text":"수행할","x":353,"y":1557,"width":97,"height":36},{"text":"것을","x":462,"y":1557,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"요청하는","x":535,"y":1557,"width":125,"height":36},{"text":"플래그를","x":669,"y":1557,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"포함한다.","x":804,"y":1557,"width":129,"height":36},{"text":"예를","x":948,"y":1558,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"들어,","x":1019,"y":1559,"width":70,"height":36},{"text":"데이터베이스는","x":1103,"y":1559,"width":217,"height":36},{"text":"이","x":1333,"y":1559,"width":26,"height":35},{"text":"기능을","x":1374,"y":1558,"width":93,"height":36},{"text":"원자","x":1479,"y":1557,"width":62,"height":36}]},{"text":"적 트랜책션에 사용하며 이는 데이터가 필요한 순서로 안전한 저장장치에 도착하는 것","words":[{"text":"적","x":312,"y":1619,"width":27,"height":35},{"text":"트랜책션에","x":357,"y":1618,"width":156,"height":35},{"text":"사용하며","x":530,"y":1617,"width":120,"height":37},{"text":"이는","x":669,"y":1617,"width":61,"height":37},{"text":"데이터가","x":744,"y":1618,"width":123,"height":36},{"text":"필요한","x":882,"y":1618,"width":91,"height":35},{"text":"순서로","x":985,"y":1619,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"안전한","x":1094,"y":1619,"width":93,"height":35},{"text":"저장장치에","x":1201,"y":1619,"width":153,"height":36},{"text":"도착하는","x":1371,"y":1618,"width":124,"height":35},{"text":"것","x":1511,"y":1618,"width":28,"height":35}]},{"text":"을 보장한다.","words":[{"text":"을","x":311,"y":1679,"width":33,"height":36},{"text":"보장한다.","x":354,"y":1678,"width":134,"height":36}]},{"text":"다른 시스템에서는 파일의 접근 유형에 따라 다른 교체 알고리수을 A卜공함으로써 페","words":[{"text":"다른","x":372,"y":1739,"width":63,"height":36},{"text":"시스템에서는","x":447,"y":1739,"width":187,"height":36},{"text":"파일의","x":645,"y":1739,"width":88,"height":36},{"text":"접근","x":750,"y":17